## Project Structure

```
ml-pipeline-template/
├── config/
│   ├── training_config.yaml      # Training hyperparameters
│   └── inference_config.yaml     # API and prediction settings
├── data/
│   └── models/                   # Trained .pkl files
├── docs/
│   ├── Training.md               # How to train models
│   ├── Scripts.md                # All scripts with arguments
│   └── Databases.md              # Database setup guide
├── scripts/
│   ├── train_with_mock_data.py   # Generate mock data + train (start here)
│   ├── test_with_mock_data.py    # Generate + display mock data
│   ├── train_model.py            # Train from config file
│   ├── analyze_target.py         # Analyze a single target
│   ├── batch_analyze.py          # Analyze multiple targets
│   └── evaluate_models.py        # Evaluate model performance
├── src/
│   ├── collectors/
│   │   └── data_sources.py       # DataRecord dataclass + RecordType enum
│   ├── preprocessing/
│   │   ├── normalizer.py
│   │   ├── deduplicator.py
│   │   └── enricher.py
│   ├── features/
│   │   └── feature_engineer.py   # ~28 features
│   ├── models/
│   │   ├── classifier.py         # 3-model ensemble classifier
│   │   ├── priority_predictor.py
│   │   └── pattern_detector.py
│   ├── training/
│   │   └── pipeline.py           # Full training pipeline
│   └── inference/
│       └── predictor.py
├── app.py                         # FastAPI server
├── main.py                        # CLI
├── INSTALL.md                     # Installation guide
├── requirements.txt
├── setup.py
└── docker/
    ├── dockerfile
    └── docker-compose.yml
```

---

## Adapting to Your Domain

This template is designed to be forked. To adapt it:

1. **Define your categories** — Edit `RecordType` enum in `src/collectors/data_sources.py`
2. **Update DataRecord fields** — Add/remove fields relevant to your domain
3. **Provide training data** — Labeled examples as DataRecord objects
4. **Tune features** — Edit `src/features/feature_engineer.py` for domain-specific features
5. **Train and evaluate** — `python scripts/train_with_mock_data.py --reports 1000`

The mock data currently generates generic typed records (10 simple stock event categories). Replace these with your own domain categories.

